### EVAL-002 refusals name what to do
$ soft-foundry ui --port 4880   (already in use)
soft-foundry: port 4880 is already in use; pass another --port, or omit it to let the system choose
exit 1
$ soft-foundry ui --port eighty
soft-foundry: --port expects a whole number from 0 to 65535; got 'eighty'
exit 1
$ soft-foundry ui --host 0.0.0.0
soft-foundry: unknown option(s): --host 0.0.0.0
exit 1
$ soft-foundry ui   (a directory with no .ai/)
soft-foundry: no .ai/workflow.yml here; run `soft-foundry init` first
exit 1

### EVAL-003 the page's data follows a record edit
before: intake: pending/pending
after marking intake in progress and waiting out the 2 s reuse: intake: in_progress/in_progress

### EVAL-007 help and output with non-ASCII bytes stripped
  soft-foundry ui [--port N]              serve a read-only page on http://127.0.0.1:N/ showing every
                                          change record phase by phase and each gate's checks; it
                                          follows the records as they change and stops on Ctrl-C
                                          (N defaults to a free port)
